sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/Approver
    participant WorkflowModule as Workflow Module
    participant ContractModule as Contract Module
    participant NotificationModule as Notification Module
    participant IdentityModule as Identity Module
    
    %% Approval Process
    User->>WorkflowModule: Submit Approval Decision
    WorkflowModule->>IdentityModule: Validate User Permissions
    IdentityModule-->>WorkflowModule: Permission Granted/Denied
    
    alt Permission Denied
        WorkflowModule->>User: Error - Insufficient Permissions
    else Permission Granted
        WorkflowModule->>WorkflowModule: Record Approval Decision
        WorkflowModule->>WorkflowModule: Evaluate Workflow State
        
        alt More Approvals Required
            WorkflowModule->>NotificationModule: Notify Next Approver
            NotificationModule->>User2: Approval Request Notification
            Note over NotificationModule: Email/In-App/Push
            
        else Final Approval Received
            WorkflowModule->>ContractModule: Workflow Completed Successfully
            ContractModule->>ContractModule: Update Contract Status
            ContractModule->>ContractModule: Set Status to Approved
            
            %% Notification Triggers
            WorkflowModule->>NotificationModule: Trigger Workflow Completion Notification
            NotificationModule->>ContractOwner: Approval Complete Notification
            NotificationModule->>AllStakeholders: Workflow Finished Notification
            
            %% Optional: Trigger Next Process
            ContractModule->>NotificationModule: Trigger Next Process (e.g., Contract Activation)
            NotificationModule->>RelevantParties: Next Process Initiated Notification
        end
    end
    
    %% Rejection Path
    alt Approval Rejected
        WorkflowModule->>ContractModule: Workflow Terminated (Rejected)
        ContractModule->>ContractModule: Update Contract Status to Draft/Rejected
        WorkflowModule->>NotificationModule: Trigger Rejection Notification
        NotificationModule->>ContractOwner: Approval Rejected Notification
        NotificationModule->>RejectedApprover: Rejection Recorded
        NotificationModule->>ProcessOwner: Workflow Termination Notice
    end
    
    %% Notification Details
    NotificationModule->>NotificationModule: Determine Notification Channels
    NotificationModule->>NotificationModule: Personalize Message Content
    NotificationModule->>EmailService: Send Email Notification
    NotificationModule->>InAppService: Create In-App Notification
    NotificationModule->>PushService: Send Push Notification (if configured)
    NotificationModule->>SMSService: Send SMS Notification (if configured)
    
    %% Audit Trail
    WorkflowModule->>ContractModule: Log Decision in Audit Trail
    ContractModule->>StorageModule: Store Audit Record
